    {
      "title": "The Real Activation Logic (Common DI + Telemetry Setup)",
      "description": "Open `_extension.ts`. This is where `reflect-metadata`, tsyringe container, Segment/Sentry, and the giant `ALL_COMMANDS` registration happens.\n\n**Look for these landmarks while the tour is here:**\n- Top of file: `import \"reflect-metadata\"` (must be first)\n- `setupLocalExtContainer()` call (the DI wiring)\n- `WorkspaceActivator.activate()`\n- The `DendronExtension` singleton pattern\n\nThis file is deliberately kept as the \"one file to rule them all\" for activation.\n\n[Open _extension.ts at the activate function](./packages/plugin-core/src/_extension.ts)\n\n>> echo 'Tip: Set a breakpoint on line 120 (the _activate function) before your next F5'",
