      "description": "The single most valuable specialized tour in this suite is the **Debugging & Breakpoints** tour.\n\nIt will teach you:\n- How to use every launch config in `.vscode/launch.json`\n- The difference between \"Run Extension\" vs Attach\n- Exactly where to set breakpoints for activation, engine indexing, lookups, publishing, etc.\n- How `DENDRON_PERF=1` + Doctor + RingBuffer work\n- Using the `debug:breakpoints`, `debug:callstack`, `debug:variables` views (this tour will auto-focus them in later steps)\n\n[Start the Debugging Tour immediately][Debugging Dendron with Breakpoints]\n\nOr continue this tour — we will link back at the end.",
