    {
      "title": "Key Monorepo Workspaces (packages/ directory)",
      "description": "The `packages/` folder is the entire product.\n\nMost important ones (you will have dedicated tours for each):\n- `plugin-core` — the VS Code extension (1.8k+ TS files)\n- `engine-server` — the note engine (DendronEngineV2, indexing, watchers, SQLite)\n- `common-all` — every type, constant, utility that is shared (changes here ripple everywhere)\n- `unified` — the remark/rehype pipeline that gives Dendron its special markdown powers (`![[note refs]]`, wikilinks, etc.)\n- `dendron-cli` — the `dendron` binary\n- `dendron-plugin-views` — all the React webviews (graph, calendar, lookup, etc.)\n\n[Explore packages/ directory](#directory:packages/)\n\nSee also the Packages Overview tour and the individual package tours under `.tours/packages/`.",
